## 🚀 5. Command Reference Cheat Sheet (`command.txt`)

```powershell
# 1. Run Live Headed Pytest Flow with Visual Slow-Mo:
cd <app_name>_test
python -m pytest tests/test_invest_flow.py --headed --slowmo 500

# 2. Run Background Excel Test Scaffolding:
python generate_test_cases.py

# 3. Run Data-Driven Tests via Excel Engine:
python tests/run_excel_tests.py
```
